### 1.1 Seeder la base de données
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/seed?numWallets=10&eventsPerWallet=100

### 1.2 Créer un nouveau portefeuille
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "email": "testclient@gmail.com",
  "initialBalance": 25000,
  "code": "WLT-TEST001",
  "currency": "XOF"
}

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 0, taille 10
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=0&size=10

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 0, taille 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=0&size=5

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles - Page 1, taille 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets?page=1&size=5

### 1.4 Consulter un portefeuille par numéro de téléphone
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/+221770000003

### 1.5 Consulter uniquement le solde à jour
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/+221770000003/balance

### 1.6 Effectuer un Dépôt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 1.7 Effectuer un Retrait
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221770000001",
  "amount": 10000.00
}

### 1.8 Effectuer un Transfert
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderPhone": "+221770000001",
  "receiverPhone": "+221770000002",
  "amount": 2000.00
}

### 1.11 Consulter l'historique des transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/+221770000001/transactions